WEBVTT

00:13:30.013 --> 00:13:34.601
as we design and build our future
cities and communities,

00:13:34.643 --> 00:13:38.021
the approach, again, is so simple.

00:13:39.565 --> 00:13:45.028
We must do so no longer leaving the most
vulnerable of us to guess

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:46.738
and hope for the best.

00:13:47.239 --> 00:13:50.492
But based on tried,
tested, traditional knowledge

00:13:50.534 --> 00:13:53.704
and lived experience,

00:13:53.745 --> 00:13:55.956
designing for the absolute worst.

00:13:57.124 --> 00:13:58.458
Thank you.

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:04.756
(Applause and cheers)